      "url": "https://developer.android.com/jetpack/androidx/releases/fragment#1.1.0-rc03",
      "detailsHtml": "<p><strong>Bug fixes</strong></p>\n<ul>\n <li>Fixed an issue where calling <code>postponeEnterTransition()</code> with a timeout more than once would not cancel previous timeouts. (<a href=\"https://issuetracker.google.com/issues/137797118\">b/137797118</a>)</li>\n</ul>",
